Z||000005||c m west||08-21-2001||08:36 PM||||tell your land lord to " bob your Knob ", seeing as how current renter/lienholder to landlord relations in any given contract state that the renter is entitled one month notice before any action can be taken against him - to the best of my knowledge<P><BR> try calling all dealerships that you can as there are complete clutch lines still in supplying wharehouses, unfortunately we got the last one in CA.<P> The fitting size is 6mm, and I have a new clutch line with the slave cylender end cut off - however, I can send you the other end wich is the same so that you can have it brazed onto your car - no worries man, we are all here to help you out<P>Eric - West Coast Fiero <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A> <BR>310-305-4111<P>||||reg||1
